<title>LEBANON: Solidere shares mixed in Beirut.</title>
<headline>Solidere shares mixed in Beirut.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Solidere shares were mixed on the Beirut Stock Exchange on Friday as A shares rose to $110 from Thursday's $108 and B shares were steady at $114.</p>
<p>Turnover in Solidere shares rose to 7,010 from 4,427 on Thursday and value was $839,586.25 from $489,278.</p>
<p>There was no trade in the shares of the four other listed companies: Ciments Libanais, Ciments Blancs, Eternit and Uniceramic.</p>
<p>The LISPI stock index rose 0.20 percent to 81.45 and the BLOM stock index also rose 0.52 percent to 937.75.</p>
<p>-Beirut editorial (9611) 353078 645456 602057</p>
</text>
